========================================================================
Acknowledgements & Design References
========================================================================

GeoVPN's architecture drew conceptual inspiration from the following open-source
projects (no source code copied or vendored, adhering to C-06):

- sing-box (SagerNet): URL-test and endpoint probe timing design concepts.
- PassWall / PassWall2: UX conventions for proxy/VPN node latency testing.
- HomeProxy: Clean ucode/rpcd/LuCI integration architecture patterns on OpenWrt 24+/25+.
- pbr (Policy-Based Routing): Interaction techniques with dnsmasq nftset and fwmark isolation.
- mwan3: Hysteresis algorithms and ping-loss thresholds for automatic failover.
- luci-proto-wireguard: Design reference for pasted WireGuard configuration parsing (Apache-2.0, zero code copied, VA-25).
- v2fly/domain-list-community & ipverse: Curated data list classifications (MIT & CC0-1.0).
